@startuml MR-PET Pipeline Overview
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #555555

title MR-PET Processing Pipeline — High Level Overview

start

:**Pipeline Setup**\nLoad config, discover MR and PET sessions,\nmatch MR↔PET by age proximity,\ngenerate SLURM job scripts;

fork
  :**FreeSurfer Reconstruction**\nRun recon-all on T1w (+ optional FLAIR);\n\n**Optional modules:**\nWMH segmentation, hypothalamic subunits,\nhippocampal subfields;\n\n**Optional atlas:**\nBrainnetome 246-region parcellation;
fork again
  note right
    PET jobs depend on FreeSurfer
    completing successfully
  end note
end fork

:**PET Registration & SUVR**\nRegister PET to T1w space;\nCalculate SUVR\n(cerebellar reference for PIB,\nraw values for Tau/MK6240);\nOptional partial volume correction (PVC);

:**ROI Quantification**\nExtract mean SUVR per region\nacross DKT, Destrieux,\nand Brainnetome atlases;

:**Quality Control**\nGenerate mosaic images for\nregistration, GM segmentation,\nSUVR map, reference region,\nand atlas overlays;

stop

@enduml
